WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:05.080
February 28th (Saturday)

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:00.450
<b>What's wrong?</b>

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:02.620
<b>Today's show is already over?</b>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:04.550
<b>Play for us!</b>

00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:55.490
<b>Now I understand.</b>

00:01:56.630 --> 00:02:00.690
<b>I've always thought that I had to thank my savior-goddesses.</b>

00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:06.630
<b>But it was just me who thought so, and I'd always end up hurting their feelings.</b>

00:02:06.630 --> 00:02:07.850
<b>I'd bring them bad luck.</b>

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:09.730
<b>I really am an idiot.</b>

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:13.870
<b>I was conceited, thinking that it was like Santa Claus or some god of luck.</b>

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:17.140
<b>Even Yuki, whose existence used to be, to me, just like the air...</b>

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:20.130
<b>Do you understand?</b>

00:02:20.130 --> 00:02:21.640
<b>I thought that as long as I'm with her,</b>

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:23.300
<b>as long as I even intend to be with her,</b>

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:25.540
<b>Yuki would be satisfied...</b>

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:27.690
<b>Even though I couldn't have been more wrong...</b>

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:34.800
<b>Because of me, because of my neglect, she was troubled and hurt.</b>

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:37.920
<b>All I see are Yuki's tears.</b>

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:40.950
<b>She's always smiling while crying.</b>

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:42.030
<b>Rina-chan,</b>

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:45.140
<b>I shouldn't be loving anybody.</b>

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:49.080
You're wrong!

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:56.020
It's not your fault

00:02:57.090 --> 00:02:58.470
Yuki and I

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:01.890
The reason the savior-goddesses became sad is

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:12.830
<b>... is because all of us love you, Fujii-kun!</b>

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:23.970
<b>It's long.</b>

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:29.520
<b>That's not the song, is it?</b>

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:33.810
<b>That's not it.</b>

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:36.940
<b>This song isn't "Koiiro Sora".</b>

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:44.590
<b>Let's stop her.</b>

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:45.240
<b>Wait.</b>

00:03:59.150 --> 00:04:09.530
Powder snow falls slowly from the sky

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:20.980
The snow that falls on my palm makes me sad

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:26.280
Are you watching from somewhere?

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:31.740
You are standing still

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:39.270
As you look up at the sky

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:44.380
Are you remembering the past?

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:54.420
The sight of you walking on the snow so happily

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:56.790
In the white snowfall

00:04:56.790 --> 00:05:09.190
Fills me with love for you

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:15.860
I still remember even now

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:21.660
The whiteness of the snow I saw that day

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:31.610
I can't forget the warmth of your lips as they touched for the first time

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:37.010
I still love you

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:41.640
<b>Who would've thought that Fujii-san would...</b>

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:42.480
<b>In a sense.</b>

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:45.400
<b>Yuki, I've always been fair.</b>

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:46.870
<b>I know.</b>

00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:56.460
<b>I'm sorry, Ei-chan.</b>

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:57.790
<b>I owe you one.</b>

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:10.720
Lots of powder snow falls onto me {LOLNEEDSFIX}

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:10.730
<b>I'll be right back.</b>

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:21.770
It is like your warm kindness

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:32.390
As you talk to me like you are having fun

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:34.470
In the white snowfall

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:47.020
My heart brims with my love for you

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:42.730
I've gone to find something. - Watch the house for me.

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:53.550
I still see it in my dreams

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:58.700
The white world I saw that day

00:06:59.470 --> 00:07:09.360
I can't forget the coolness of your fingertips as they touched then

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:13.360
I still love you

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:15.650
I still remember even now

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:21.030
The whiteness of the snow I saw that day

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:31.710
I can't forget the warmth of your lips as they touched for the first time

00:07:31.710 --> 00:07:37.350
You are like powder snow

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:42.550
Unblemished and clean

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:53.940
I pray to the snow that I can be just like you

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:59.710
I still love you

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:36.900
<b>You'll forget it all.</b>

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:38.600
<b>Those who bully you,</b>

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:43.230
<b>and even that annoying girl who sticks to you like a bug...</b>

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:46.590
<b>Yes, that girl.</b>

00:08:46.590 --> 00:08:50.050
<b>The girl who is always watching you and laughing happily from the shadows.</b>

00:08:55.650 --> 00:09:00.160
It seems that it is time

00:08:56.900 --> 00:09:00.160
for my memories to return

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:38.050
<b>It was a few months before Yuki moved away.</b>

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:41.970
<b>That was the first time Yuki and I met.</b>

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:24.510
<b>Eww, yuck!</b>

00:10:24.510 --> 00:10:25.820
<b>This guy pissed in his pants!</b>

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:27.160
<b>You serious?!</b>

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:31.150
<b>If only a boy with piss on his hands wasn't around!</b>

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:37.910
<b>Yeah, you pussy!</b>

00:11:05.320 --> 00:11:07.180
Well done

00:11:24.550 --> 00:11:28.080
I'm sorry

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:28.080
for making you wait

00:11:44.150 --> 00:11:45.900
<b>Was it on the way back,</b>

00:11:45.900 --> 00:11:48.590
<b>or was it at the door of my house?</b>

00:11:48.590 --> 00:11:51.180
<b>I still can't remember.</b>

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:54.300
<b>My dad was waiting,</b>

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:55.540
<b>and when I finally realized...</b>

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:02.640
<b>What did you throw away?</b>

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:05.760
<b>Why did you throw away something you worked to get?</b>

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:08.070
<b>Even though you play with them all the time,</b>

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:11.370
<b>you're still an idiot who doesn't understand a girl's feelings at all.</b>

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:14.710
<b>If you didn't want it, apologize properly to her and return it.</b>

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:17.200
<b>Find it.  Go and get it back!</b>

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:27.390
<b>In the end, you didn't manage to find the medal,</b>

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:30.250
<b>and these chain of experiences resulted in trauma,</b>

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:32.810
<b>and your memories were sealed.</b>

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:34.720
<b>From beginning to end,</b>

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:37.550
<b>the only true savior-goddess was Yuki.</b>

00:12:37.550 --> 00:12:40.360
<b>Yet, you threw away this goodwill too.</b>

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:43.300
<b>Whether you wanted to thank her or apologize to her,</b>

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:46.030
<b>Yuki had already transferred to another school.</b>

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:48.600
<b>And coincidentally, Menou-san appeared,</b>

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:51.490
<b>and you got a tangible savior-goddess.</b>

00:12:51.490 --> 00:12:54.080
<b>Already, there was nothing else you could do.</b>

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:58.440
<b>To you, the savior-goddesses that appeared after that</b>

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:01.640
<b>were all substitutes for Yuki you yourself constructed.</b>

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:07.370
<b>The price of your apology to Yuki is one you will never be able to repay.</b>

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:15.210
<b>I thought it was something like that.</b>

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:19.390
<b>Though, you really are unlucky.</b>

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:23.440
<b>If you'd quickly remembered all of it when you met Yuki in high school,</b>

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:27.100
<b>you could've apologized to her, and thanked her.</b>

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:31.450
<b>If you dated her with your body and mind both relieved,</b>

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:34.370
<b>you wouldn't have needed to live so unhappily like this...</b>

00:13:35.780 --> 00:13:39.130
<b>If he remembered, they wouldn't be dating.</b>

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:40.970
<b>Am I right, Touya?</b>

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:43.070
<b>I wonder...</b>

00:13:43.070 --> 00:13:45.410
<b>Yuki's been waiting for you this whole time.</b>

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:47.660
<b>Waiting for you to remember.</b>

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:50.430
<b>Waiting for you to release her from the group of savior-goddesses...</b>

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:54.090
<b>Waiting for the reply you should've given her ten years ago.</b>

00:13:54.980 --> 00:14:01.220
<b>Why didn't Haruka-chi tell Fujii... san about Yuki-chan?</b>

00:14:01.220 --> 00:14:03.220
<b>Haruka was waiting too.</b>

00:14:03.220 --> 00:14:04.390
<b>For what?</b>

00:14:04.390 --> 00:14:06.020
<b>For you.</b>

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:08.780
<b>It's already over.</b>

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:09.960
<b>What is?</b>

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:11.600
<b>She's fine now.</b>

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:17.450
<b>What about Matsuyama Menou?</b>

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:19.110
<b>Menou-san...</b>

00:14:19.110 --> 00:14:21.790
<b>... has been watching Yuki warily as a rival.</b>

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:23.970
<b>That's not it.</b>

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:28.490
<b>Even after she went over to her father's, she seemed to still come over regularly.</b>

00:14:28.490 --> 00:14:31.520
<b>She said she was watching Mana-chan from afar.</b>

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:34.680
<b>And then, she watched Yuki and Mana-chan play together.</b>

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:40.150
<b>And as she was keeping tabs on Yuki, she reached you, whom Yuki was chasing.</b>

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:43.570
<b>That's because she didn't want Yuki to take Mana-chan away from her.</b>

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:44.570
<b>You, too.</b>

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:45.240
<b>Akira-</b>

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:46.640
<b>Ribbit!</b>

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:49.270
<b>As I thought, that woman's mad.</b>

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:49.980
<b>Mana-chan-</b>

00:14:49.980 --> 00:14:53.350
<b>So, my sister's the reason stingy Aesop lives the way he does...</b>

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:55.660
<b>It's enough to bring tears to my eyes!</b>

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:57.990
<b>You're calm, Mana-chan.</b>

00:14:57.990 --> 00:15:01.590
<b>Even when your mother's company and your sister are in big trouble.</b>

00:15:01.590 --> 00:15:02.320
<b>Akira!</b>

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:07.760
<b>That's only because they engaged in such shameless business that wouldn't have even tricked a child.</b>

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:10.030
<b>You reap what you sow.  They deserved it.</b>

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:14.850
<b>It's the Big Boss.</b>

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:16.060
<b>Ah, she came.</b>

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:19.540
<b>You're probably thinking I followed her here.</b>

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:20.980
<b>No.</b>

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:22.830
<b>Like I'd mess up that badly!</b>

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:28.370
<b>Well, I have somewhere I need to go...</b>

00:15:28.370 --> 00:15:29.990
<b>Eh?  No way...</b>

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.340
<b>Bye, Mana-chan.</b>

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:33.130
<b>You want to go with him.</b>

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:34.130
<b>No I don't.</b>

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:45.250
<b>Ah, so you buy manga magazines!</b>

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:47.080
<b>I don't normally read them...</b>

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:49.790
<b>But my exams are over, and I thought it might be nice once in a while,</b>

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:51.880
<b>so I accidentally bought it...</b>

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.540
<b>Who do you like?</b>

00:15:57.540 --> 00:16:01.630
<b>Ogishima Mokoto and Koyama Yumiko.</b>

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:04.170
<b>Wow, this is still being serialized?</b>

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:08.900
<b>I think it's about to end, though.</b>

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:11.840
<b>What would you like?</b>

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:13.140
<b>Milk tea.</b>

00:16:13.140 --> 00:16:14.120
<b>Would you like another cup?</b>

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:15.550
<b>Ah, yes please.</b>

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:22.790
<b>Copycat.</b>

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:24.160
<b>Who's the copycat?</b>

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:47.610
Well done

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:51.290
<b>How did you know I had it?</b>

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:53.650
<b>That's because I couldn't find it even though I searched so hard.</b>

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:09.130
<b>How long will it take you to find it?</b>

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:11.170
<b>Continue tomorrow.</b>

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:18.540
<b>I think it was the third or fourth day that I met Menou-san.</b>

00:17:20.050 --> 00:17:23.560
<b>If someone had picked it up, it must've been you.</b>

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:33.190
<b>Why didn't you tell me?</b>

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:35.020
<b>Because you never asked.</b>

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:53.310
<b>Yuki's waiting for you.</b>

00:17:53.310 --> 00:17:54.060
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:18:02.990 --> 00:18:04.520
Yuki

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:06.860
<b>You have to go celebrate, right?</b>

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:08.460
<b>It's not going to be a celebration.</b>

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:23.170
<b>Encore...</b>

00:18:23.170 --> 00:18:25.500
<b>They've been disqualified.</b>

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:28.540
<b>The broadcast has been messed up.</b>

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:32.030
<b>Then it's a pity party.</b>

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.460
<b>Are you going to go?</b>

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:07.470
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:19:12.470 --> 00:19:13.520
<b>How about going?</b>

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:19.680
<b>Yeah.</b>

