Some day during March

00:21:26.170 --> 00:21:28.220
<b>And that should be it!</b>

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:30.050
<b>Thank you!</b>

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:35.730
<b>Hey, isn't it about time you told me which university you're going to?</b>

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:36.410
<b>Don't want to.</b>

00:21:37.930 --> 00:21:39.460
<b>It's Kazehamaurara.</b>

00:21:40.560 --> 00:21:42.750
<b>Fuurei Girl's Academy...</b>

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:47.710
<b>Isn't that... the first choice school your mother requested?!</b>

00:21:47.710 --> 00:21:49.950
<b>Awesome!  That's awesome, Mana-chan!</b>

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:53.680
<b>What's more, since it was the literature major exam, math wasn't included.</b>

00:21:53.680 --> 00:21:56.780
<b>Onee-chan, don't say unnecessary things!</b>

00:21:56.780 --> 00:21:59.570
<b>What's wrong?  What are you pretending to be in front of Touya-kun...</b>

00:21:59.570 --> 00:22:01.540
<b>I'm not pretending to be anything in front of...</b>

00:22:01.540 --> 00:22:03.160
<b>Wait, what do you mean by "Touya-kun"?</b>

00:22:03.160 --> 00:22:05.270
<b>"Touya-kun" is Touya-kun, obviously.</b>

00:22:05.270 --> 00:22:07.560
<b>But why were you studying math?</b>

00:22:07.560 --> 00:22:09.140
<b>That's because...</b>

00:22:14.290 --> 00:22:16.400
<b>How about hiding in the truck?</b>

00:22:16.950 --> 00:22:19.110
<b>I'll treat you to some soba.</b>

00:22:19.110 --> 00:22:21.650
<b>I'm sorry, I have something to do after this...</b>

00:22:21.650 --> 00:22:25.090
<b>Since you have a license, I could've hired you as a driver.</b>

00:22:25.090 --> 00:22:26.310
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

00:22:27.400 --> 00:22:29.240
<b>We're leaving, Mana.</b>

00:22:29.240 --> 00:22:30.040
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:38.010
<b>Aesop-san.</b>

00:22:38.010 --> 00:22:41.030
<b>Was it a golden axe that you dropped?</b>

00:22:41.030 --> 00:22:43.080
<b>Or was it a silver axe?</b>

00:22:45.610 --> 00:22:47.530
<b>Ah, I get it!</b>

00:22:47.530 --> 00:22:49.430
<b>This is a personality test, right?</b>

00:22:50.780 --> 00:22:53.080
<b>The axe I dropped wasn't that great.</b>

00:22:54.130 --> 00:22:55.080
<b>It was a bronze axe!</b>

00:22:58.150 --> 00:22:59.630
<b>Are you an idiot?!</b>

00:23:06.890 --> 00:23:08.700
<b>Goodbye, Touya-kun.</b>

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:29.010
<b>And all is right in the world, huh?</b>

00:23:28.500 --> 00:23:37.670
I can't forget the coolness of your fingertips as they touched then

00:23:37.670 --> 00:23:41.050
I still love you

00:23:38.950 --> 00:23:43.920
I still remember even now

00:23:43.920 --> 00:23:49.030
The whiteness of the snow I saw that day

00:23:49.590 --> 00:23:59.020
I can't forget the warmth of your lips as they touched for the first time

00:23:59.020 --> 00:24:04.630
You are like powder snow

00:24:01.970 --> 00:24:07.100
What I lost...

00:24:04.630 --> 00:24:09.710
Unblemished and clean

00:24:10.640 --> 00:24:20.240
I pray to the snow that I can be just like you

00:24:20.240 --> 00:24:25.070
I still love you

00:24:21.710 --> 00:24:32.340
Page 26
We are sitting together.
For the whole night,
we did not move.

00:24:24.870 --> 00:24:33.510
R. Browning

00:24:25.300 --> 00:24:26.320
<b>Fujii-kun!</b>

00:24:26.320 --> 00:24:27.450
<b>Touya!</b>

00:24:27.450 --> 00:24:28.410
<b>Fujii-san.</b>

00:24:28.410 --> 00:24:29.880
<b>Aesop!</b>

00:24:29.880 --> 00:24:31.390
<b>Fujii-kun.</b>

00:24:31.400 --> 00:24:33.530
<b>Touya-kun.</b>
